@startuml LIRA_Use_Case_Diagram
title APC Library Intelligent Research Assistant (LIRA)\nUse Case Diagram
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor black
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam dpi 160
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ActorBorderColor black
skinparam UsecaseBorderColor black
skinparam UsecaseBackgroundColor white
skinparam PackageBorderColor black
skinparam PackageBackgroundColor white
skinparam linetype ortho

actor Librarian as Librarian
actor "Student / Faculty" as User
actor "AI Service" as AI
actor "External System\n(Koha ILS)" as Koha

rectangle "APC Library Intelligent Research Assistant (LIRA)" {
  usecase "UC-01\nManage E-Books\nLibrary Catalog" as UC01
  usecase "UC-02\nView E-Books\nLibrary Catalog" as UC02
  usecase "UC-03\nManage Chatbot" as UC03
  usecase "UC-04\nAsk Chatbot" as UC04
  usecase "UC-05\nManage Reports" as UC05
  usecase "UC-06\nE-Book Recommendations" as UC06
  usecase "UC-07\nGenerate Citation" as UC07
  usecase "UC-08\nRetrieve E-book Summary" as UC08
  usecase "UC-09\nSave and Organize a\nPersonal Reading List" as UC09
  usecase "UC-10\nRead an Available\nDigital Book" as UC10
}

Librarian -- UC01
Librarian -- UC03
Librarian -- UC05
User -- UC02
User -- UC04
User -- UC06
User -- UC07
User -- UC08
User -- UC09
User -- UC10
Koha -- UC01
Koha -- UC02
AI -- UC04
AI -- UC06
AI -- UC07
AI -- UC08

note bottom of UC06
Microsoft 365 sign-in and the proper role are preconditions.
Recommendations currently use deterministic scoring;
AI chatbot, citation, and summary features are planned.
end note
@enduml

@startuml LIRA_Manage_Catalog_Lower_Level
title LOW-LEVEL USE CASE: MANAGE E-BOOKS LIBRARY CATALOG\nAPC Library Intelligent Research Assistant
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor black
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam dpi 160
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ActorBorderColor black
skinparam UsecaseBorderColor black
skinparam UsecaseBackgroundColor white
skinparam PackageBorderColor black
skinparam PackageBackgroundColor white
skinparam linetype ortho

actor Librarian as Librarian
actor "External System\n(Koha ILS)" as Koha
rectangle "APC Library Intelligent Research Assistant (LIRA)" {
  usecase "UC-01\nManage E-Books\nLibrary Catalog" as Manage
  usecase "Create E-Book Record" as Create
  usecase "Read / Find E-Book Record" as Read
  usecase "Update E-Book Record" as Update
  usecase "Delete E-Book Record" as Delete
  usecase "Upload Cover Image" as Cover
  usecase "Upload PDF or EPUB\nDigital Resource" as Resource
}
Librarian -- Manage
Koha -- Manage
Create ..> Manage : <<extend>>\n[Add a record]
Read ..> Manage : <<extend>>\n[Find or inspect a record]
Update ..> Manage : <<extend>>\n[Edit a record]
Delete ..> Manage : <<extend>>\n[Remove a record]
Cover ..> Create : <<extend>>\n[Optional cover]
Cover ..> Update : <<extend>>\n[Replace cover]
Resource ..> Create : <<extend>>\n[Optional digital file]
Resource ..> Update : <<extend>>\n[Attach or replace file]
note bottom of Manage
Precondition: librarian has an eligible Microsoft 365 account,
an authorized librarian role, and Koha permissions.
end note
@enduml

@startuml LIRA_View_Catalog_Lower_Level
